1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,483
This is AI;DR.

2
00:00:02,483 --> 00:00:04,791
Here's what's new this week.

3
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:06,560
Every 30 minutes,

4
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:08,069
AI;DR reads its sources

5
00:00:08,069 --> 00:00:10,226
and skips any that keep failing.

6
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:12,524
Vietnamese text is checked

7
00:00:12,524 --> 00:00:14,754
for syllables no Vietnamese word uses.

8
00:00:14,754 --> 00:00:16,400
Older stories too.

9
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:20,185
Day card headlines never go below 23 px.

10
00:00:20,185 --> 00:00:22,283
Crowded tiles become rows.

11
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:24,490
Before any email goes out,

12
00:00:24,490 --> 00:00:25,755
it is claimed first.

13
00:00:25,755 --> 00:00:26,939
If two runs overlap,

14
00:00:26,939 --> 00:00:28,562
only one sends.

15
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:30,653
You can now follow

16
00:00:30,653 --> 00:00:33,900
AI;DR in any RSS reader.

17
00:00:34,550 --> 00:00:36,106
And on four and five story days,

18
00:00:36,106 --> 00:00:38,251
Telegram lists every story.

19
00:00:39,550 --> 00:00:40,409
Share a story,

20
00:00:40,409 --> 00:00:41,315
and its photo now

21
00:00:41,315 --> 00:00:43,390
fills half the card.

22
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:47,179
The release notes list every change.
